{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"null\" initial=\"p\">\n  <parallel id=\"p\">\n    <state id=\"r1\"><transition event=\"go\" cond=\"In(r2)\" target=\"done\"/></state>\n    <state id=\"r2\"><transition event=\"go\" cond=\"In(r3)\" target=\"done\"/></state>\n  </parallel>\n  <final id=\"done\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml079-null-in-unquoted.scxml"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":0,"notes":0,"total":2,"warnings":2},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml079-null-in-unquoted.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":2,"byteOffset":162,"endColumn":54,"endLine":3,"startColumn":52,"startLine":3},"insertedContent":{"text":"'r2'"}}]}],"description":{"text":"quote the state ID `'r2'`"},"properties":{"applicability":"machine-applicable"}}],"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml079-null-in-unquoted.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":54,"endLine":3,"startColumn":52,"startLine":3}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`In(r2)` passes `r2` unquoted, but the null data model takes the state ID as a quoted string\n\n**Note:** the null data model's only condition is `In('stateID')` with the state ID in single or double quotes; it rejects any other condition, `In(stateID)` without quotes included, so evaluating it raises `error.execution` and the condition is false\n\n**Help:** quote the state ID: `In('r2')`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §B.1 The Null Data Model","text":"`In(r2)` passes `r2` unquoted, but the null data model takes the state ID as a quoted string"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":164,"start":162},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"the null data model is selected here"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml079-null-in-unquoted.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":77,"endLine":1,"startColumn":73,"startLine":1}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML079"},{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml079-null-in-unquoted.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":2,"byteOffset":242,"endColumn":54,"endLine":4,"startColumn":52,"startLine":4},"insertedContent":{"text":"'r1'"}}]}],"description":{"text":"use the quoted state ID `'r1'`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml079-null-in-unquoted.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":54,"endLine":4,"startColumn":52,"startLine":4}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`In(r3)` passes `r3` unquoted, but the null data model takes the state ID as a quoted string\n\n**Note:** the null data model's only condition is `In('stateID')` with the state ID in single or double quotes; it rejects any other condition, `In(stateID)` without quotes included, so evaluating it raises `error.execution` and the condition is false\n\n**Help:** `r3` is not a state of this machine; did you mean `In('r1')`?\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §B.1 The Null Data Model","text":"`In(r3)` passes `r3` unquoted, but the null data model takes the state ID as a quoted string"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":244,"start":242},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"the null data model is selected here"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml079-null-in-unquoted.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":77,"endLine":1,"startColumn":73,"startLine":1}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML079"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"},"fullDescription":{"text":"SCXML 1.0 §B.1: \"There is no location expression language.\", \"There is no value expression language.\", and the condition language \"consists of the In predicate only\" (`In('stateID')`, the ID quoted as a string). Any other expression is ill-formed there, and §5.9.4 lets the processor \"wait and place 'error.execution' in the internal event queue at runtime when the expressions are evaluated\", which this toolchain does (a condition is then false), so the document compiles"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: rewrite conditions as `In('stateID')` and remove the other expressions, or select a data model such as `ecmascript`.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §B.1 The Null Data Model\n\nRun `scxml-cli --explain SCXML079` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#minimal-profile","id":"SCXML079","name":"SCXML079","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"an expression is used under the null data model"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}